# Wusuq Paralegal Platform — Comprehensive System Report
**Prepared for:** Mobile App Development Initiative  
**Date:** March 2026  
**Exploration Method:** Live admin portal walkthrough (read-only)  
**URL:** https://wusuq.com  

---

## 1. Executive Overview

**Wusuq** is a paralegal services management platform designed for the Pakistani legal market. It connects consumers who need legal document processing (case files, FIR copies, registry deeds, etc.) with field representatives ("Clerks") who physically acquire these documents from courts and government offices.

The platform operates on a **ticket-based workflow**: consumers create service requests, administrators assign them to local clerks, and clerks fulfill them — all tracked via a centralized admin portal with financial management, wallet-based payments, and reporting.

**Brand Identity:** "Helping You Is Our Purpose"  
**Primary Market:** Pakistan (Province/District/City structure, PKR currency, Pakistani payment methods)

