## 3. Module-by-Module Breakdown

---

### 3.1 Dashboard

**Purpose:** High-level analytics and performance overview.

**Analytics Cards:**
- Weekly Revenue
- Weekly Expense  
- Weekly Growth

**Charts:**
- Revenue vs. Expense (line/bar chart)
- Ticket Trends: New vs. Completed cases over time

**Entry Point:** Defaults to "Pending Tickets" upon login, with analytics accessible via Dashboard nav link.

