### 3.2 Paralegal Services

**Purpose:** Service catalog and order creation interface. Acts as the gateway to create new paralegal tickets.

#### 3.2.1 Judicial Services

**Case Files** (5-Step Form)

| Step | Name | Fields |
|------|------|--------|
| 1 | Service Selection | Select Service (Lower/High/Special/Federal Shariat/Supreme Court), Select Court, Select Court City |
| 2 | Case Details | Case Status (Pending/Decided/Unknown), Case Type, Case/Petition No, Case Year, Case Title (A vs B), Judge Name, Judge Designation |
| 3 | Required Documents | Previous/Future/Decided Case Dates, Document selection (Paperbook, Petition, Orders, etc.) |
| 4 | Others Info | No. of Sets, Set Type (Attested/Non-Attested/Both), Mode of Delivery (Courier/Self Collected), Address, Notes |
| 5 | Documents & Delivery | File upload for supporting documentation |

**Case Information** (4-Step Form)
- Similar to Case Files with streamlined 4-step process
- Focus: Case identification and basic document requirements

**Case Search** 
- Search for existing case records in court systems

**Case Filling**
- Filing petitions/documents with courts
- Multi-step form for petition details

**Power of Attorney**
- Legal authorization document service
- Multi-step form for party details and authorization scope

#### 3.2.2 Non-Judicial Services

**Copy of Registry/Deed** (4-Step Form)

| Step | Name | Fields |
|------|------|--------|
| 1 | Service Selection & City | Office Name, Select City, City Type (City/Sadar/Unknown) |
| 2 | Case Particulars | Doc No., Year, Title, Date |
| 3 | Required Documents & Other | Delivery mode, Address, No. of Sets, Set Type |
| 4 | Images & Delivery Mode | File upload |

**Copy of FIR** (4-Step Form)

| Step | Name | Fields |
|------|------|--------|
| 1 | Service Selection & City | Province/Capital, District, Police Station, City Type |
| 2 | Case Particulars | FIR No, Year, Title, Date |
| 3 | Required Documents | Delivery mode, Address, No. of Sets, Set Type |
| 4 | Images & Delivery | File upload |

