### 3.3 Paralegal Tickets

**Purpose:** Central operations hub — tracks all service orders from creation to completion.

#### Ticket Statuses
| Status | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| **Pending** | Newly created, awaiting assignment |
| **Assigned** | Assigned to a representative/clerk |
| **In Progress** | Clerk is actively working on it |
| **Completed** | Service delivered to consumer |
| **Immature/Archive** | Cancelled or incomplete tickets |

#### Table Columns (All Ticket Lists)
- SR #
- Batch No
- Consumer Name
- Service Type
- Service Category
- Service City
- Case Type
- Assign Members
- Other Charges (Delivery/Photocopy)
- Service Cost (e.g., PKR 3,500)
- Status
- Actions

#### Ticket Actions
| Action | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| **Ticket Panel** | Deep detail view with all case info + representative assignment |
| **Edit** | Modify ticket details |
| **Update Status** | Quick status change |
| **Delete** | Remove ticket |
| **Regenerate/Clone** | Duplicate a ticket |
| **Download Invoice** | Generate PDF invoice |
| **Upload Supporting Files** | Attach additional documents |

#### Ticket Detail Panel Fields
- Consumer Info (Name, Contact, CNIC)
- Case Details (all form data from creation)
- Requirements (documents requested)
- Representative Assignment (assign/unassign clerk)
- Charges Breakdown
- Payment Status
- Timeline/History

#### Filters & Search
- Search box (real-time by batch/consumer/ID)
- Grouped by status (sidebar navigation)
- Date range filter
- Service type filter

