### 3.7 Manage Cost

**Purpose:** Dynamic pricing configuration for services and clerk commissions.

#### Service Cost Configuration
**Structure:** Costs are set based on combination of service type + province + case type + year range.

**Form Fields:**
- Select Service (Judicial/Non-Judicial type)
- Select Service Category (court level or office type)
- Select Case Type (Pending / Decided / Unknown)
- Select Province
- Select Audience (consumer type)
- Cost (PKR amount)
- Year Mode: Current/Single Year vs Year Range
- Year Selection

#### Clerk Cost Configuration
**Structure:** Same as service cost but sets what clerks earn per service.

**Form Fields:**
- Select Service
- Select Service Category
- Select Case Type
- Select Province
- Cost (PKR amount for clerk commission)
- Year Selection

