| **Cabinet** | id, election_id, position, member_name, votes, tenure |
| **Document** | id, ticket_id, name, type, file_url, uploaded_at |

---

## 8. Identified Gaps & Opportunities for Mobile App

1. **No mobile app** — currently web-only
2. **Sidebar navigation** is not mobile-optimized
3. **Multi-step forms** need tap-friendly redesign for mobile
4. **Document scanning** via camera would improve UX significantly
5. **Real-time push notifications** not present (web only has bell icon)
6. **Clerk workflow** is entirely admin-driven — a dedicated clerk app would improve field operations
7. **Payment is manual** — mobile could enable direct payment gateways
8. **No offline support** — needed for clerks in remote court areas with poor connectivity

