## 9. Verified Additions (Live Re-Analysis on March 18, 2026)

This section adds **confirmed technical and functional details** found during a second authenticated walkthrough of `https://app.wusuq.com`.

### 9.1 Deployment Split (Corrected)
- `https://wusuq.com` is a **WordPress marketing site** (theme/plugins based, public pages, sitemap, wp-json).
- `https://app.wusuq.com` is the **actual operations portal** used for tickets, finance, wallet, users, pricing, reports, etc.

### 9.2 App Tech Stack (Verified from rendered pages/assets)
- Backend/session/auth: **Laravel** (`/login` form + CSRF token + Laravel-style session cookies).
- Frontend pattern: **Laravel Blade + jQuery-heavy admin UI**, not a pure Next.js SPA.
- Build/assets: Vite-like bundled assets under `/build/assets/...`.
- Libraries observed in runtime pages:
  - `jQuery`
  - `DataTables` + `Buttons` (`csv`, `pdf`, `colvis`)
  - `ApexCharts`
  - `TomSelect` / `choices.js`
  - `flatpickr`
  - `intl-tel-input`
  - `inputmask`
  - `axios`
  - `toastr`

### 9.3 Auth & Access Behavior
- Login form accepts **Email or Phone** + Password.
- Dashboard role label observed: **Super Admin**.
- Password reset route present: `/forgot-password`.

### 9.4 Core Authenticated Route Map (Observed)
- Dashboard: `/dashboard-analytic`
- Services:
  - `/services/judicial`
  - `/services/nonjudicial`
- Tickets:
  - `/tickets` (Pending)
  - `/completed-tickets`
  - `/archive-tickets` (Immature)
  - `/assigned-tickets`
  - `/active-tickets` (In Progress)
- Finance & Wallet:
  - `/finance`
  - `/wallet`
  - `/transactionsHistory?id={user_id}`
- Users & Clerks:
  - `/users`, `/users/create`
  - `/clerks`, `/clerks/create`
  - `/profiles`
- Cost Management:
  - `/servicecosts`, `/servicecosts/create`
  - `/clerkcosts`, `/clerkcosts/create`
- Elections:
  - `/election/listings`
  - `/elections/create`
  - candidates flow: `/addCandidates/{id}`, `/candidates/{id}`
- Reports:
  - `/report`
  - `/report/logs`
  - `/report/cases/processed`
  - `/report/cases/services`
  - `/report/cases/city`
  - `/report/cases/status`
  - `/report/cases/turnaround`
- Documents:
  - `/documents`

